PubMedQA — licence and attribution
==================================

This directory redistributes data derived from PubMedQA.

SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Licence:                 MIT
Full licence text:       https://opensource.org/license/mit
Upstream dataset:        https://huggingface.co/datasets/qiaojin/PubMedQA

Files in this directory
-----------------------
  pubmedqa.json

Modifications
-------------
The data here is not the upstream distribution. It has been modified as follows,
and these changes are the responsibility of the Prj-BENCH authors, not the
upstream authors:

  - Converted to the common Prj-BENCH multiple-choice JSON schema
    (id / question / options / target / kind).
  - pqa_labeled configuration, 1,000-item subset.
  - No quality-control exclusions applied (this is the pre-QC release).

ACTION REQUIRED
--------------
The MIT licence requires that the upstream copyright notice and the full
licence text be distributed with the work. Paste the PubMedQA project's own
LICENSE file below this line, replacing this notice.
